  decl_scope_err_own.pcpp - break step of decl_scope.pcpp:
  a variable used in its own initializer

  How to check, from repo\bin:
    pcpp res\tests\decl_scope_err_own.pcpp
    pcpp res\tests\decl_scope_err_own.pcpp -t x86_64-linux-gnu
  The marked line reports that code; nothing else is reported.
